agm-0984: AGM H6 Wi-Fi for iOS, part 1. agm_wcn_sipc.c becomes the transport with a service loop
(agm_sipc_cmd() from any thread, agm_wifi_event() for events); bsd/dev/agm_wifi.c brings the firmware up
(SYNC_VERSION, DOWNLOAD_INI, GET_INFO, OPEN) and is the station side of sys/redwood_sta.h with en0 (scan and
what was heard; no join or data yet). agm_wcn_start() starts MiniIONetworkStack for configd.

